# Worktrees live inside the repository, and each one holds a whole checkout.
# The leading slash matters: it anchors the pattern to this directory, so the
# rule cannot reach a directory of the same name somewhere else in the tree.
# The rest of .claude/ stays tracked — settings and skills belong to the repo.
